referred to in paragraph (B)&#8239;above and the Existing Issued Shares be cancelled immediately upon the repurchase (the &ldquo;Repurchase
of Shares&rdquo;);</P>
                                                                                                                                                                         <P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0 0pt 0.5in; text-align: justify">&#8239;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0 0pt 0.5in; text-align: justify">D) immediately following the Repurchase
of Shares, the authorised but unissued share capital of the Company be reduced by the cancellation of (a)&#8239;1,015,049,250,000 Class&#8239;A
ordinary shares of a par value of US$0.00135 each, (b)&#8239;100,000,000,000 Class&#8239;B ordinary shares of a par value of US$0.00135
